{
    "title": "Scoreholio",
    "description": "Whether you are running a backyard tournament or a 512 team mega tournament Scoreholio is the app for you. Running a tournament is easy peasy, all you need to do is Pre-Register or Check-in your players, hit start tournament, and let the app handle the rest. In-app tournament push notifications and colorful dashboards will help guide your players from check-in to championship. \r\n\r\n\u201cScoreholio can take you from 0 to hero in less than a week! \u201cEasy Peasy\u201d to use and caught on like wildfire here in South Mississippi!\u201d - Daniel T\r\n\r\n\u201cScoreholio is so amazing \u2014 almost makes it too easy to run a tourney.\u201d - Jeff C\r\n\r\nNot in a tournament? Use our digital Freeplay scoreboard to keep track of all your pickup and practice games. \r\n\r\nNot sure what kind of tournament to run? Try out our super fun Switcholio format that pairs different partners up every round.\r\n\r\nPlaying Cornhole? We have the most innovative scoreboard in the sport. Use ScoreMagic to track every bag you throw. \r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\u2022 Formats: Round robin, single elimination and double elimination bracket, Squadholio, Pool Play\r\n\u2022 Pre-Registration with Pre-Payment: Share your tournament and let players sign up in advance. Collect entry fees right from the app!!\r\n\u2022 Push Notifications: App notifies players when they're up, and which court they're on\r\n\u2022 Global and Club Rankings: Think you can compete globally? Join now to get on the Scoreholio leaderboard\r\n\u2022 Game Tracking: Make a player profile and Scoreholio will track every game you play\r\n\u2022 Scan Check-in: Quickly register players by scanning their QR code or adding them manually\r\n\u2022 Interactive Scoreboards: Colorful real-time scoreboards at each court, on any supported tablet or phone\r\n\u2022 Dashboard: Real-time scores, standings, and brackets displayed in-app and on TVs\r\n\u2022 Flexibility: Easily set # of courts and rounds, time limit, etc., even change them during the event\r\nOrganizers: Join the \"Scoreholio Organizers & Players\" group on Facebook for help and tips from our growing community of users!\r\n\u2022 Basic scoreboard for your favorite Wear OS device.\r\n\r\nSupported Sports:\r\n\u2022 Billiards\r\n\u2022 Cornhole\r\n\u2022 Darts\r\n\u2022 Horseshoes\r\n\u2022 Pickleball\r\n\u2022 Pong\r\n\u2022 Table Shuffleboard\r\n\u2022 Table Tennis (Ping Pong)\r\n\u2022 Volleyball\r\n\u2022 Other Sports (Use for any sport not listed above)\r\n\r\nLegal stuff: If you decide to purchase a subscription to unlock advanced features, it will be charged to your credit card through your iTunes account. Your subscription will automatically renew unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage your subscriptions in Account Settings after purchase.\r\n\r\nBy using Scoreholio, you agree to our Terms of Use: https://scoreholio.com/tou",
    "descriptionHTML": "Whether you are running a backyard tournament or a 512 team mega tournament Scoreholio is the app for you. Running a tournament is easy peasy, all you need to do is Pre-Register or Check-in your players, hit start tournament, and let the app handle the rest. In-app tournament push notifications and colorful dashboards will help guide your players from check-in to championship. <br><br>\u201cScoreholio can take you from 0 to hero in less than a week! \u201cEasy Peasy\u201d to use and caught on like wildfire here in South Mississippi!\u201d - Daniel T<br><br>\u201cScoreholio is so amazing \u2014 almost makes it too easy to run a tourney.\u201d - Jeff C<br><br>Not in a tournament? Use our digital Freeplay scoreboard to keep track of all your pickup and practice games. <br><br>Not sure what kind of tournament to run? Try out our super fun Switcholio format that pairs different partners up every round.<br><br>Playing Cornhole? We have the most innovative scoreboard in the sport. Use ScoreMagic to track every bag you throw. <br><br>FEATURES<br>\u2022 Formats: Round robin, single elimination and double elimination bracket, Squadholio, Pool Play<br>\u2022 Pre-Registration with Pre-Payment: Share your tournament and let players sign up in advance. Collect entry fees right from the app!!<br>\u2022 Push Notifications: App notifies players when they&#39;re up, and which court they&#39;re on<br>\u2022 Global and Club Rankings: Think you can compete globally? Join now to get on the Scoreholio leaderboard<br>\u2022 Game Tracking: Make a player profile and Scoreholio will track every game you play<br>\u2022 Scan Check-in: Quickly register players by scanning their QR code or adding them manually<br>\u2022 Interactive Scoreboards: Colorful real-time scoreboards at each court, on any supported tablet or phone<br>\u2022 Dashboard: Real-time scores, standings, and brackets displayed in-app and on TVs<br>\u2022 Flexibility: Easily set # of courts and rounds, time limit, etc., even change them during the event<br>Organizers: Join the &quot;Scoreholio Organizers &amp; Players&quot; group on Facebook for help and tips from our growing community of users!<br>\u2022 Basic scoreboard for your favorite Wear OS device.<br><br>Supported Sports:<br>\u2022 Billiards<br>\u2022 Cornhole<br>\u2022 Darts<br>\u2022 Horseshoes<br>\u2022 Pickleball<br>\u2022 Pong<br>\u2022 Table Shuffleboard<br>\u2022 Table Tennis (Ping Pong)<br>\u2022 Volleyball<br>\u2022 Other Sports (Use for any sport not listed above)<br><br>Legal stuff: If you decide to purchase a subscription to unlock advanced features, it will be charged to your credit card through your iTunes account. Your subscription will automatically renew unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage your subscriptions in Account Settings after purchase.<br><br>By using Scoreholio, you agree to our Terms of Use: https://scoreholio.com/tou",
